--- Mr. Arthur Hale's diary, Sunday, the 4th of January, 1931 (3/4 key facts kept) ---
To-day I finished my ledgers, and resolved never to let myself get into arrears with my work. I also resolved never to spend more than a certain sum in a week, and find myself short till Friday.

